&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role sits in our Platform Engineering team, which delivers features and design work that spans the Ping platform. The team is focused on building Ping&#39;s identity for AI offerings to secure and govern AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer who can turn ideas into production capabilities and work well in a fast-paced, collaborative, cross-functional, and global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal applicant will bring strong software development experience, sound technical judgment, creative problem-solving skills, and a passion for research, innovation, and experimentation. They will be excited by work that spans products, services, APIs, models, and user experiences, and by using AI tooling as a practical part of the engineering workflow to accelerate discovery and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to contribute to features that help customers identify, secure, and govern AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Will&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver IAM (Identity &amp;amp; Access Management) capabilities across the Ping platform encompassing the whole stack from infrastructure and databases through to UI experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and implementation of APIs, models, workflows, orchestration surfaces, and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and prototype solutions in emerging areas, working with senior technical leaders and product teams to turn validated ideas into product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product management, UX, and engineering teams across Ping to refine features and designs to deliver elegant, usable, and scalable outcomes for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in development life cycle activities such as design, coding, testing, rollout, and production support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use modern AI tooling such as Claude Code as part of day-to-day engineering work to accelerate research, code understanding, prototyping, implementation, and documentation while maintaining strong engineering judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly, share knowledge, and support other engineers through design discussions, code reviews, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a rapidly changing environment, continuously adapting to evolving customer needs, technology trends, and new ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design, build, test, and operate production services using technologies such as Java, JavaScript, Google Cloud, Docker, and Kubernetes, together with the desire to broaden your expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use AI engineering tools to accelerate research, code understanding, prototyping, implementation, and documentation while applying sound engineering judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production services, distributed systems, or shared platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing APIs, RESTful services, integration contracts, and data or domain models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning requirements and ambiguous problems into designs, prototypes, and production-ready solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with authentication, authorisation, and identity management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate technical decisions clearly, collaborate across teams and time zones, and support other engineers through feedback and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus Points If You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, token exchange, policy systems, delegated administration, or identity data modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI agent identity and non-human identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MCP, agent skills, and other agent integration concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple codebases, teams, or product areas to ship cohesive outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as part of an international team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to technical designs and proof of concept work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About The Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Maneuver Dominance Division’s mission is to reboot Vertical Flight. Our portfolio of UAS&amp;nbsp;are the cornerstone of these capabilities, and we continually strive to push the boundaries of&amp;nbsp;what’s possible in endurance, autonomy and mission capability. The Maneuver Dominance Team develops and maintains core products and payloads and adapts and applies those&amp;nbsp;products to serve a wide variety of defense, IC and commercial customers in US and&amp;nbsp;international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About The Job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an Associate Director, Strategic Execution to join the Strategic Execution team in Washington DC or London, UK. This role will require you to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Business Development, Division Operations, and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FP&amp;amp;A to manage pipelines, refine strategic reporting, planning processes, and resource prioritization that support aggressive growth targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze top-line data, maintain TAM assignments, and translate sales pipeline demand into planning inputs to surface trends and enable data-backed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and address recurring business process challenges at the intersection of Business Development, Operations, and Finance, leveraging quantitative analysis to drive innovative, sustainable process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage advanced data analysis to distill complex data into strategic narratives tailored for executive stakeholders, enabling faster and more informed decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute on multiple special projects at once across an array of areas as they arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have exceptional communication skills, both written and verbal, with the ability to present complex information clearly and concisely to diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated high-energy, high-ownership individual who will drive performance and exhibit strong management skills with a high level of emotional intelligence. Must be able to work in a fast-paced, highly entrepreneurial, and creative environment, and be able to build, adapt, and implement new and innovative approaches to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable navigating ambiguity, framing analytical problems, and taking ownership of cross-functional projects from start to finish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an aptitude for rapid learning and assimilating new information to swiftly become proficient in unfamiliar subject areas and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re highly detail oriented and data-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re tactical and don’t only sit at a 30,000 foot level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 4-10 years of varied experience in an operating role at a high-growth company, or in finance or consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with CRM tools, especially Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with international government business development, government contract structures, and government proposal processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior military or contracting experience, or experience in Government&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£166,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£220,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With 30 offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Der fehlende Wirkungsnachweis ist das größte Problem im stationären Handel für Werbungtreibende. Obwohl Marken Millionen in Werbung am Point of Sale investieren, können sie nicht belegen, ob daraus Käufe wurden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Verve Retail Media (VRM) löst dieses Problem. Wir vermarkten und betreiben digitale Werbe-Screens in mehreren tausend LEH-, Drogerie- und Convenience-Standorten und verbinden sie mit digitalen Coupons, Retargeting im CTV und anderen Offsite-Kanälen. Marken buchen bei uns keine isolierten Werbeformate, sondern 360-Grad-Kampagnen, die zu Hause starten und bis zum Einkaufsregal reichen - eine Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;VRM ist die eigenständige Retail Media Unit der börsennotierten Verve Group SE. Wir arbeiten wie ein schnell skalierendes Startup mit AI-First-Strategie über alle Funktionen und mit Zugriff auf die Infrastruktur eines internationalen AdTech-Unternehmens mit über einer Billionen ausgelieferter Werbeimpressionen pro Jahr. Zur Verve Retail Media gehört seit kurzem der Couponing- und Cashback-Spezialist acardo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle in einem &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Satz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Du trägst eine Hunter-Mentalität in dir und gewinnst neue Umsätze bei FMCG-Marken, indem du integrierte Shopper Activation Kampagnen verkaufst: d.h. coupon-getriebene Conversion und messbarer Sales Lift, idealerweise erweitert um Screen-Präsenz im Markt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;du&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Die Aktivierung von Shoppern am Point of Sale (über Coupons, Cashback und andere Aktivierungsmethoden), erweitert um digitale Sichtbarkeit im Markt (Screens an Eingang, Fläche, Kasse) und Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten, teils auch losgelöste Coupon oder Cashback Maßnahmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Kampagnen, die zu mehr Abverkauf und Kategorie-Relevanz &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;führen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Konkrete Beweispunkte aus vielen tausenden acardo &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Kampagnen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An wen du &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Direkt an FMCG-&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Marken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Die Ansprechpartner kommen meist aus dem Trade Marketing oder Category &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Eigene Pipeline aufbauen, entwickeln, priorisieren und mit belastbarem Forecast &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;führen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Neukunden und Stakeholder (horizontal und vertikal) gewinnen und Kunden zu wiederkehrenden Partnern entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Bestehende Kunden ausbauen zu hohen, wiederkehrenden &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Volumina&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p11&quot;&gt;Den kompletten Sales-Zyklus verantworten: Erstansprache, Qualifizierung, Bedarfsanalyse, Angebot, Verhandlung und Abschluss. Mit Abschluss erfolgt die Übergabe ans AdOps Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Kundenziele in Aktivierungskonzepte übersetzen: Touchpoints, Reichweiten, Zielgruppen, Mechaniken (Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), Messansatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Feedback aus dem Markt in Produkt, Pitchmaterial und Go-to-Market &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;zurückspielen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So ist die Rolle &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;aufgesetzt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Du bist ein Individual Contributor ohne &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Personalverantwortung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Du berichtest direkt an den Head of Key Account &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Du verkaufst eigenständig, aber nicht allein: Inside Sales unterstützt bei der Abwicklung, Ad Operations steuert die Auslieferung, Data Science liefert den Wirkungsnachweis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li8&quot;&gt;Dein Fokus ist kommerziell: Pipeline, Abschluss, Kundentiefe, &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Wiederbuchung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p12&quot;&gt;Du passt zu uns, wenn du aus einer der folgenden Richtungen kommst und mindestens 3 Jahre Erfahrung mitbringst:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 1: FMCG Trade Marketing / CM-Side. &lt;/strong&gt;Du hast Erfahrung im Trade Marketing, Category Management, Shopper Marketing, oder Brand Marketing auf Herstellerseite. Du kennst Freigabelogiken, Jahresgespräche, Aktivierungsmechaniken und die Realität am Point of Sale. Du willst auf die Sell-Side wechseln und traust dir zu, eigenständig Deals abzuschließen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 2: Promotion-, Couponing-, Cashback- und Sampling-Vermarkter (acardo-Mitbewerber). &lt;/strong&gt;Marktguru, reebate, Sampling-/Produkttest-Anbieter, klassische Sales-Promotion-Dienstleister. Du sprichst bisher mit den gleichen Einkäufern, über das gleiche Budget, und gleiche Mechaniken (Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), und bringst bestehende Kontakte direkt im richtigen Buying Center mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 3: Sales-Data- / Markt-Measurement-Vertrieb. &lt;/strong&gt;Du kommst aus dem Vertrieb bei NielsenIQ, Circana, IRI, GfK oder ähnlichen Data oder Insights Anbietern, und hast dort den Closed-Loop- und Sales-Lift-Pitch an das Category Management verkauft. Deshalb beherrschst du die Sprache „Abverkauf / Wirkungsnachweis / Kategorie-Relevanz&quot; – also genau das Herzstück unseres Versprechens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil 4: Loyalty-/CRM-/Couponing-Plattformen, die in FMCG-Trade-Budgets verkaufen. &lt;/strong&gt;Dein zuhause war bisher bei Payback, DeutschlandCard und ähnlichen CRM Anbietern. Dein Wirkungskreis waren Coupon-Mechanik plus Daten, verkauft an Trade Marketing. Dadurch bringst du entsprechende Kundenkontakte mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Für&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;alle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;gilt:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Du bist kommerziell getrieben, mit klarem Gespür für Dealstruktur, Pricing und &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Kundennutzen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Souverän auf Senior-Level: z.B. Trade-Marketing-Entscheider, Marken &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Direktoren&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Strukturiert in Pipeline-Pflege und &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Forecasting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Kannst mit Daten argumentieren, hast keine Scheu vor AI-Tools und neuen &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Sprichst Deutsch und Englisch &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;fließend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;diese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Du liebst es, Dinge erfolgreich zu machen. Du nutzt unsere erprobte Vermarktungsmaschine und im Markt bekannte Produkte, mit denen du Deals gewinnst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Echte Ownership: deine Pipeline, deine Kunden, dein &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Umsatz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Direkter Zugang zu CSO und CEO bei strategischen &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Kunden&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li6&quot;&gt;Ein Produkt, das mehr kann als Aktivierung verkaufen: Sichtbarkeit, Reichweite und messbare Wirkung bis zum Kauf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li16&quot;&gt;AI-gestützte Tools und Workflows, die deine Produktivität &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;vervielfachen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;Wenn du bestehende Playbooks magst, die du immer weiter optimierst, ist das die richtige &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Rolle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bewerbungsprozess&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p19&quot;&gt;Schick deinen Lebenslauf zusammen mit einer kurzen Arbeitsprobe (max. 1 Seite). Wähle eine reale Situation: einen Deal gegen Widerstände gewonnen, eine Kundenbeziehung von Null aufgebaut, ein neues Konzept mit messbarem Ergebnis oder ein kommerzielles Problem, das du gelöst hast. Was wir verstehen wollen:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Was war das Problem? Nicht der Kontext. Das tatsächliche &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li7&quot;&gt;Was hast du getan? Nicht das Team. Was hast du entschieden, gebaut oder &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;verändert?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li10&quot;&gt;Was war das messbare Ergebnis? Umsatz, Conversion, Kundenbindung. Sei &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;konkret.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li20&quot;&gt;Was würdest du heute anders &lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;machen?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p6&quot;&gt;Schreib es wie ein Memo, das dein CEO in 3 Minuten lesen kann. Ohne Füllmaterial. Die Arbeitsprobe ersetzt das Anschreiben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p22&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Verve bietet allen Mitarbeitenden und Bewerber:innen gleiche Beschäftigungschancen und verbietet Diskriminierung und Belästigung&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;jeglicher&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Art,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;unabhängig&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;von&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Herkunft,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Geschlecht,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Religion,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alter,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;sexueller&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Orientierung,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Geschlechtsidentität, Behinderung oder anderen gesetzlich geschützten Merkmalen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

